<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1920 1080" width="1920" height="1080">
  <!--
    Akira アキラ — wallpaper
    .akira/themes/wallpaper.svg
    GENERATED by scripts/theme.sh — do not edit by hand.
    Source: themes/akira.env

    Rendered to PNG for hyprpaper. Regenerating locally needs JetBrains Mono
    and a CJK font (noto-fonts-cjk), plus any SVG rasteriser.

    The background is the exact background token, so the compositor gaps read
    as negative space instead of a different image showing through.
  -->
